&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Present: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct highly effective product demonstrations with prospective customers and LogicGate Account Executives as part of the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead client workshops for data and process gathering to uncover details of current state processes, related business challenges, and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discover:&lt;/strong&gt; Listen to understand customer pain points and connect their needs to LogicGate solution features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Configure LogicGate&#39;s no-code platform for customized demonstrations and proof of concept projects with prospective customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consult:&lt;/strong&gt; Build relationships with prospective customers and become a trusted advisor throughout the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educate: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct webinars and assist in content creation (white papers, blog posts, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide feedback and intelligence to the Product team to identify new potential features and functions and represent the voice of prospective customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Customer Success and Implementation Management teams in the transition of customers to ensure a seamless experience post-sale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own: &lt;/strong&gt;Take full ownership of the technical cycle across your territory — from first discovery call through to a clean handoff post-close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools We Use to Help You Make the Most of Your Time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-Powered RFP Automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Agents to support demo and POC configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gong for call recording, note-taking, and onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to AI to streamline your day to day activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
